  "notes": [
    "Merge after A018, A019 and A022. Image paths are relative to each entry source. Existing torso/side/back and Q pelvis anchors reference their original files; never resolve those images in A023.",
    "anchors are absolute pixels on the 1536x2304 source canvas. waist is a shared attachment reference, distinct from the inherited part pivot. Keep the pivot unchanged; align child anchors in each selected view.",
    "Static proof only. Runtime view/depth switching, per-pose shield/beam bands and carry sockets belong to T028/T029. No runtime changes are delivered.",
    "All hand swaps share original hand pivots. Open-palm/cup/point grip records are contact sockets rather than weapon slots. Smear grips use fist centers; verify blade occlusion in viewer.",
    "New view/key paint is reference-guided, not pixel-identical master paint. Seam repair foreground pixels are unchanged."
  ],
